may be soon disturbed.

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:21.440
Thank you.

00:18:32.100 --> 00:18:36.380
Young rhesus monkeys play in the shrinking remnants of a waterhole.

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:03.470
Thank you.

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:40.830
By early July,

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:44.520
