00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:52.270
Weaver birds are sowing strands of grass to form their intricate hanging nests.

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:04.070
All the work is done by the brightly coloured male.

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:07.980
Only if a female approves his handiwork will she move in.

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:17.620
By the time the weaver bird's eggs hatch...

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:19.500
