00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.570
For people, and peacock alike,

00:20:49.000 --> 00:20:50.420
Life is about to change.

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:28.440
as the storm clouds gather.

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:29.900
The peacocks dance.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:31.240
reaches its peak.

